    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be teoðungum.] [Ld] ⁊ sy ælcere geoguðe teoðinge gelæst be pentecosten ⁊ ðara eorðwæstma be emnihte ⁊ ælc ciricsceat to Martinus mæssan, be þam fullan wite þe seo domboc tæcð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the tithe of all young animals shall be rendered by Pentecost, and that of the fruits of the earth by the Equinox, and every church due shall be rendered by Martinmas, under pain of the full penalty which the written law prescribes.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ síe ælcre geoguðe teoðung gelæst be pentecosten ⁊ þara eorðwæstma be emnihte; ⁊ ælc cyricsceat sy gelæst be Martinus mæssan, be þam fullon wite, þe seo domboc tæcð.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
